<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>09 · FALSIFIABILITY</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        What would change our mind
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FF6B6B', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>WOULD OVERTURN THE CLAIM</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
                {[
                    ['01', 'A5 is built, and it pays', 'Chain input at a fixed architecture beats the descriptor arm — or A3 given A2\'s 30 trials closes the gap.'],
                    ['02', 'Tier 1 stops being below tier 2', 'At matched n we measured −0.033 and −0.087, both intervals excluding zero. Either one crossing zero ends the claim.'],
                    ['03', 'Λ at the largest n falls below half', 'The ratio is 0.650. Under the absolute ruler it does halve (0.167) — we report that beside H2, not instead of it.'],
                    ['04', 'The shuffle control erases the gain', 'With A5 constructible and a working shuffle, H3 becomes decidable for the first time.'],
                ].map(([num, head, body]) => (
                    <Box key={num} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#93A8C2', width: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{num}</Text>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{head}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{body}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1, background: '#24334C' }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4D8DFF', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>WOULD NOT</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>
                {[
                    ['A bigger sample of the same kind', 'That is the intervention H2 already tests — and inside 22,242 rows Λ did not halve.'],
                    ['A different chain-aware architecture', 'Both arms are negative overall (7 of 11 and 5 of 8 cells), though they disagree in sign in 4 of the 8 shared cells — which is why they are never averaged.'],
                    ['Dropping the deepest cell', 'It moves ρ from +0.000 to +0.527. We report both; deleting it afterwards is the move pre-registration forbids.'],
                ].map(([head, body], i) => (
                    <Box key={head} style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 13, paddingBottom: 13, borderTop: i === 0 ? '0px solid #1D2A40' : '1px solid #1D2A40' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{head}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#93A8C2', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{body}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFB020', marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                Stated before the defence, so the criteria can be attacked here rather than in the questions.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>Group 32 · How Much Is a Chain Worth?</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>15 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
